<section class="model-architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
  <header class="architecture-intro">
    <p>Selected model</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="architecture-title">Compact waveform classification with confidence-based rejection</h2>
      <p>
        Two lightweight waveform branches combine into a normalized embedding. 
        The classifier scores each event along the ripple–IED axis and rejects low-confidence predictions as noise.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <figure>
    <div class="architecture-map">
      <div class="stream waveform-stream">
        <p class="stream-label">Waveform path</p>
        <div class="module input-module">
          <span>Input</span>
          <strong>Multichannel waveform</strong>
          <small>channels × 128 time samples</small>
        </div>
        <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        <div class="module">
          <strong>Shared per-channel 1-D CNN</strong>
          <small>The same encoder processes every channel</small>
        </div>
        <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        <div class="module">
          <strong>Waveform adapter + morphology summary</strong>
          <small>Spike · short oscillation · long oscillation</small>
        </div>
        <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        <div class="module paired-module">
          <span><strong>Cross-channel attention</strong><small>Relate channels</small></span>
          <span><strong>Max pool</strong><small>One 64-D summary</small></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stream feature-stream">
        <p class="stream-label">Global-feature path</p>
        <div class="module feature-module">
          <span>Five standardized features</span>
          <ul>
            <li>Ripple-band coherence</li>
            <li>Mean entropy</li>
            <li>Mean power ratio</li>
            <li>Entropy variation</li>
            <li>Power-ratio variation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        <div class="module">
          <strong>Two-layer feature encoder</strong>
          <small>5 → 32 → 32</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="merge-stage">
        <p class="stream-label">Late fusion</p>
        <div class="merge-inputs" aria-label="Inputs to late fusion">
          <span>Waveform summary · 64</span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">+</i>
          <span>Global embedding · 32</span>
        </div>
        <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        <div class="module embedding-module">
          <strong>Concatenate and project</strong>
          <small>64-dimensional normalized embedding</small>
        </div>
        <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        <div class="module score-module">
          <span>Decision head</span>
          <strong>One binary ripple–IED logit</strong>
          <small>Confidence is the score magnitude |z|</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="decision-stage">
        <p class="stream-label">Calibrated decision</p>
        <div class="decision-rules">
          <div>
            <strong>Low confidence</strong>
            <span>|z| below calibrated threshold</span>
            <b class="noise"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Noise</b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Confident score</strong>
            <span>|z| at or above threshold</span>
            <p>
              <b class="ripple"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Ripple</b>
              <b class="ied"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>IED</b>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="removed-paths">
      <span>Removed after ablation</span>
      <s>Spectrogram encoder</s>
      <s>Temporal convolution</s>
    </aside>

    <div class="model-facts" aria-label="Selected model facts">
      <p><strong>73,985</strong><span>trainable parameters</span></p>
      <p><strong>64</strong><span>embedding dimensions</span></p>
      <p><strong>0</strong><span>dropout in frozen configuration</span></p>
    </div>

    <figcaption>
      The selected <code>compact_wave_no_temporal</code> model retains waveform and global
      features. It is a binary classifier with a separately calibrated rejection rule instead of a
      direct three-class softmax.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

